Package: m6APrediction
Type: Package
Title: Prediction of m6A RNA Modification Sites with a Random Forest Model
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R:
    person("Yihan", "Ma", email = "yihan.ma24@student.xjtlu.edu.cn", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: m6APrediction predicts whether a candidate RNA site is an N6-methyladenosine
    (m6A) modification site from transcriptomic features (GC content, RNA type, RNA
    region, exon length, distance to splice junction, evolutionary conservation and a
    DNA 5-mer). A pre-trained random forest classifier returns both the modified-site
    probability and a binary Positive/Negative call.
